  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">BMP Promotion and Protection of WHR in BGD</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">BMP Promotion and Protection of WHR in BGD</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project goal is to contribute towards reducing gender inequality and promoting social inclusion, upholding women&apos;s human rights, and strengthening democracy and governance in Bangladesh.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">The project goal is to contribute towards reducing gender inequality and promoting social inclusion, upholding women&apos;s human rights, and strengthening democracy and governance in Bangladesh.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project will work with the following components/objectives:

- To generate an inclusive social movement to promote womens human rights and reduce gender-based violence; 

- To strengthen democratic practices and increase womens political participation;

- Enhance the capacity of BMP and key stakeholders as a human rights organization; and

- Increase resilience and sustainability through climate-change response environmental adaptation and mitigation in vulnerable communities.</narrative>
  </description>
